/target

# The reference clones (see refs/README.md) are five whole third-party
# repositories checked out for reading, two of them GPL-3.0. They are never
# committed here — only the README that records what they are and how they
# may be used.
/refs/*
!/refs/README.md

# Verification captures. They are window-scoped screenshots of a real machine
# and repeatedly caught real client repository names, branch names naming
# unreleased features, and fragments of real prompts — see `AGENTS.md`'s
# standing capture-safety rules. The written reports beside them are the
# durable record and stay; the images are local-only.
/docs/evidence/*.png

# The patched gpui fork checkout, populated by `scripts/setup-gpui-patch.sh`.
# It is a whole third-party monorepo, and it is what the root `Cargo.toml`'s
# `[patch]` section points at.
/.gpui-fork-patched
